+$$Y_{b,n,k} = \sum_{j=0}^{F_{in}-1} X_{b,n,j} \cdot W_{i_b,j,k} + B_{i_b,0,k}$$
+where $X$ is the input tensor, $W$ is the weight tensor, and $B$ is the bias tensor [S1].
